      "text": "App States:\n    - Selected Timeline / Set Selected Timeline\n    - Selected Event / Set Selected Event\n \nSide Bar Properties:\n    - Selected Timeline / Set Selected Timeline\n    - Selected Event / Set selected Event\n\nBottom Bar Properties:\n    - Total Number of Events\n    - Selected Event Index\n\nMap Properties:\n    - Selected Event / Set Selected Event\n\nNavigation Menu:\n    - Selected Timeline / Set Selected Timeline\n    - Selected Event / Set Selected Event",
